{{trans-see|retread|retread}}

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{senseid|en|retreaded tire, noun}} A tire that has had new [[tread]] glued on.
#: {{syn|en|retread#Noun}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2008|title=Law for Business and Personal Use|isbn=0538445882|author=John Adamson|page=102|passage=As she did so, Stacy noted that the tire had been a '''recap'''—a tire created by gluing a new outer portion of tread onto the worn inner core of old tires.}}

